  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Phytoplankton database",
  "description": "Phytoplankton community speciation and abundance, biomass, pigment concentration and composition for various locations along coastal British Columbia. May be data collected for projects such as JGOFS, GLOBEC, La Perouse, SUPER, Line P, Station P, Haida Eddy, euphausid stock assessment, Bowie Seamount, harmful algal blooms.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Supports scientific and environmental research.\n\nSupplemental information: Physical samples exist for this dataset. Custom software is available for use with this dataset.",
